Description: SubwaySurfers-Linux 1.0 — World Tour: Zurich
 SubwaySurfers-Linux v1.0 packaging for Subway Surfers World Tour: Zurich
 (underlying game build ZurichNewPrivacy v1.94.0, Unity 2019.4.18f1) with WASD
 movement controls, unified shared save storage
 (~/.local/share/SubwaySurfers-Linux/Save/), invisible event-driven autosave,
 atomic file writes, crash recovery, exclusive save locking, and fullscreen
 startup (F11 toggle).
